WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.630
A new term has its own checklist.

2
00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.949
Open New term in the top bar.

3
00:00:05.949 --> 00:00:09.889
It lays out the start of
every term, in order.

4
00:00:09.889 --> 00:00:13.304
Each card opens the right
place to make the change.

5
00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:16.906
Create the term, then set when
enrollment opens and closes.

6
00:00:16.906 --> 00:00:20.706
Then point each course at the new
term, and post the term-start event.

7
00:00:20.706 --> 00:00:24.111
It reads the website each
time, so you can stop halfway.

8
00:00:24.111 --> 00:00:29.027
Come back and press Check
again. Done steps turn green.
